OL,3,GNEWSAPrecision cancer treatment 'a huge
OL,4,Agame-changer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdvanced high-powered precision
OL,7,Fradiotherapy has been called a
OL,8,F"game-changer" for patients in the
OL,9,FSouth West by charity Prostate Cancer
OL,10,FUK.
OL,12,FIn June 2026 NHS England announced the
OL,13,Ftechnique called SABR (stereotactic
OL,14,Fablative radiotherapy) would target the
OL,15,Fdisease more effectively than standard
OL,16,Fradiotherapy and help reduce
OL,17,Fside-effects.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34602
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1789565171
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAPrecision cancer treatment 'a huge
OL,4,Agame-changer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTorbay Hospital said Stephen
OL,7,FDwyer-Lapthorne has become the first
OL,8,Fman in Torbay and South Devon to
OL,9,Freceive the treatment, following a
OL,10,Fdiagnosis of localised prostate cancer
OL,11,Fin October 2025.
OL,13,FDwyer-Lapthorne said he would encourage
OL,14,Fother people to use SABR if it was
OL,15,Favailable to them because it was "all
OL,16,Fover much more quickly".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
